  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c59921a22062079419e0bffed4cfa04b, type: 3}
  m_Name: D-02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DispatchScenarioData
  scenarioId: D-02
  readyForPlay: 1
  sourceNotes: "Kaynak: kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n 17.10.2026 tarihli k\u0131sa senaryo metni. Yaln\u0131zca konu\u015fmalar ve se\u00e7enekler g\u00fcncellendi; oyun kurallar\u0131 korundu."
  opening:
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: 912 Acil, dinliyorum. Adres ve durumunuz?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Mara\u015f \u00e7ar\u015f\u0131day\u0131z evlad\u0131m. B\u00fcy\u00fck salland\u0131k, duvarlar \u00e7atlak! Emekli \u00f6\u011fretmen Mehmet ben."
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: Mehmet Bey, b\u00f6lgenize sa\u011fl\u0131k ekibi y\u00f6nlendiriyorum, yaralanma var m\u0131?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Mehmet: Yok ama art\u00e7\u0131 gelir diye korkuyoruz. Kap\u0131 pervaz\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131na dikileyim diyorum eski evlerdeki gibi!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Mehmet: Evlad\u0131m, art\u00e7\u0131 gelirse kap\u0131 pervaz\u0131nda duray\u0131m de\u011fil mi? En sa\u011flam yer oras\u0131d\u0131r!"
    fromOperator: 0
  choiceA: "Evet Mehmet Amca, kap\u0131 pervaz\u0131 g\u00f6vdeyi korur, oraya ge\u00e7in!"
  choiceB: "Hay\u0131r! Kap\u0131 pervaz\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 de\u011fildir, sa\u011flam bir koltu\u011fun yan\u0131na \u00e7\u00f6k\u00fcn!"
  correctChoiceIsB: 1
  resourceA: 2
  resourceB: 2
  dispatchA: 1
  dispatchB: 1
  outcomeA:
  - text: "Mehmet: Pervaza ge\u00e7tim... AHHH! Art\u00e7\u0131 vurdu, kap\u0131 \u00e7arpt\u0131, \u00fcst lento kafama d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcyo---"
    fromOperator: 0
  outcomeB:
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: Mehmet Amca sak\u0131n! Pervaz ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 de\u011fildir, koltu\u011fun yan\u0131na b\u00fcz\u00fcl\u00fcn!"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Mehmet: \u00c7\u00f6kt\u00fck mindere... Hafif sallad\u0131 yine, s\u0131valar kap\u0131n\u0131n oraya d\u00f6k\u00fcld\u00fc hep. Koltuk korudu bizi, s\u0131yr\u0131klar\u0131m\u0131z var sadece, ekipleriniz pansuman yapt\u0131 sa\u011f olas\u0131n."
    fromOperator: 0
